    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Poisoned Coat",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger A creature adjacent to Blue Viper hits him with a melee unarmed Strike.\n\n---\n\nEffect The triggering creature is exposed to Dragon Bile. This consumes the poison, and Blue Viper can't use Poisoned Coat again until he spends 10 minutes applying one dose of contact or injury poison to his clothing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Pinpoint Poisoner",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "When Blue Viper successfully Strikes an Off-Guard creature with a poisoned weapon or exposes an off-guard creature to an inhaled poison, the creature takes a –2 circumstance penalty to its initial save against that poison.\n\nEffect: Pinpoint Poisoner"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Poison Spray",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements Blue Viper is holding a contact or injury poison.\n\n---\n\nEffect Blue Viper swigs the poison and sprays it out of his mouth, affecting a 15-foot cone. Blue Viper isn't exposed to the poison. All creatures in the cone are immediately exposed to the poison and each creature must attempt a Fortitude save against the poison."
    },
